@anon.863986d00e4103fb69f29fe2b65b0919.744 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [477 x i8] }> <{ [477 x i8] c"The content used to fill the space between the element's outline and\0Aits page number, as defined by the outline element this entry is\0Alocated in. When `{none}`, empty space is inserted in that gap instead.\0A\0ANote that, when using show rules to override outline entries, it is\0Arecommended to wrap the filling content in a [`box`] with fractional\0Awidth. For example, `{box(width: 1fr, repeat[-])}` would show precisely\0Aas many `-` characters as necessary to fill a particular gap." }>, align 1
